<<<
moire)(moiré. Moire, or moire antique, is the name of the watered silk material; moiré is first an adjective meaning watered like moire (often of metal surfaces), & secondly a noun meaning watered surface or effect.
===
**moire)(moiré.** *Moire*, or *moire antique*, is the name of the watered silk material; *moiré* is first an adjective meaning watered like moire (often of metal surfaces), & secondly a noun meaning watered surface or effect.
